GEN~ REPO[PROJECT-SINGULAR] > MVP[FULL-STACK]

CORE![TRIANGLE] : UI[SWIPE] + LOCK[SUDDEN-DEATH] + EXIT[COST:TIME]

PROC~[FLOW]
> STATE[A:ARENA] : UI[STACK] + ACT[SWIPE] > DB[TABLE:SWIPES] (LOGIC: LIVE-ROUNDS)
> TRIG[RECIPROCAL] > ENG[REDLOCK] : ATOMIC! (CHK[BOTH=HUNTER] ? LOCK! : FAIL)
> EFCT[GHOST] : LOCK! > REMOVE[FROM-STACK] + SUSPEND[PENDING-SWIPES]
> STATE[B:LOCKED] : UI[FULL-INT] + NAV[DISABLE] > CHAT[ONLY]

ARCH~[TECH]
> DB[PG] : SCHEMA![STATE: HUNT|LOCK|COOL] + CONSTR[INTEGRITY]
> LOCK[REDIS] : ALG[REDLOCK] > RACE-COND[SOLVED]
> RT[SOCK.IO] : EVT[MATCH-LOCKED] > UI[UPDATE]

EXT~[REWARD] > ECON[SOCIAL] : CURR[INFLUENCE] + STAT[MV]
> PHIL~[ECON] : "EARN-RIGHT-TO-HUNT" > VAL[RESPONSIVE + DESIRE]
> MECH[EARN] : REPLY[<30m] > INF[+10] | EXIT[CLEAN] > INF[+50] | BID-RX > SHARE[%]
> MECH[SPEND] : KNOCK > COST[INF] | BOUNTY > COST[INF+$$] | COOL-
> STAT[MV] : CALC(BIDS + REPLIES - FLAKES) > TIER[BRONZE|SILVER|GOLD|PREDATOR]
> FEAT[POACH] : ACT: HUNT[C] > BID[LOCKED:A] > IF A-SPLITS-B > C[BADGE:STEAL] + A[MV++]
> UI~[LOCKED] : METER[THREAT] (VIS: RIVALS > GEN[MATE-GUARD])
